<import src="../../templates/common.wxml"/>

<view class="page page--bar">
  <template wx:if="{{rows.length === 0}}" is="state-empty"
            data="{{mark: '·', title: '购物车是空的', hint: '先去菜单挑几道菜吧', actionText: '去点菜'}}"/>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="section"><view class="section-title">已选菜品</view>
      <view class="section-hint" bindtap="clear">清空</view></view>

    <view class="card">
      <view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="code" class="cart-row">
        <view class="grow">
          <view class="title">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="muted" style="margin-top: 6rpx;">
            {{item.category}} · 参考 {{item.estimate_minutes}} 分钟
          </view>
          <view class="caption" style="margin-top: 6rpx;" bindtap="remove" data-code="{{item.code}}">移除</view>
        </view>
        <view class="col" style="align-items: flex-end;">
          <view class="price">￥{{item.subtotal_text}}</view>
          <view class="stepper" style="margin-top: 12rpx;">
            <view class="stepper__btn" bindtap="minus" data-code="{{item.code}}">－</view>
            <view class="stepper__num">{{item.qty}}</view>
            <view class="stepper__btn stepper__btn--primary" bindtap="plus" data-code="{{item.code}}">＋</view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section"><view class="section-title">用餐信息</view></view>
    <view class="card">
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{tableLabels}}" value="{{tableIndex}}" bindchange="onTableChange">
        <view class="list-link">
          <view class="kv__k">桌台</view>
          <view class="row gap-8"><text class="kv__v">{{tableLabels[tableIndex]}}</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view>
        </view>
      </picker>
      <view class="list-link">
        <view class="kv__k">合计</view>
        <view class="kv__v price">￥{{summary.money_text}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="list-link">
        <view class="kv__k">参考时长</view>
        <view class="kv__v num">{{summary.minutes}} 分钟</view>
      </view>
      <view class="caption" style="margin-top: 16rpx;">
        参考时长按单道菜估算取最长值；实际出餐时间以下单后服务端的预计时刻为准。
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card card--flat">
      <view class="caption">
        下单时会锁定当前价格与配方版本，已在制作的订单不会受后续改配方影响；
        若某道菜刚好沽清，整单会被拒绝并列出菜名，购物车会保留供你调整。
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>

<view wx:if="{{rows.length > 0}}" class="bottom-bar">
  <view class="btn {{submitting ? 'disabled' : ''}} btn--block" bindtap="submit">
    {{submitting ? '提交中…' : '确认下单 · ￥' + summary.money_text}}
  </view>
</view>
